  "summary": "BEIJING, Sept. 16, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Kaixin Holdings (“Kaixin” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: KXIN) today announced that all resolutions presented to the shareholders at its annual general meeting held on September 13, 2025 (the “Annual General Meeting”) were duly passed.",
